	(text "5 V from the USB-C connector down to 3.3 V, for this board and for\nthe two remote sense nodes.\n\nCONSTRAINTS\n\n1. AP2112K-3.3 in SOT-23-5, 600 mA. It is stable with ceramic\n   output capacitors, so the 1 uF input and 1 uF output parts as\n   drawn are correct and do not need a tantalum.\n\n2. This board does not power the device under test. 3.3 V leaves\n   over the JST-PH only to run the remote INA226 and the remote\n   PCA9615. The DUT powers itself and the harness only senses its\n   rail. This keeps the sense side on harness ground, which is what\n   a shared timebase needs, and it keeps the regulator small.\n\n3. VBUS carries a PWR_FLAG because nothing on this board drives it.\n   Use exactly one PWR_FLAG per undriven net. A second one on the\n   same net makes ERC report two power outputs connected together,\n   which is a false alarm that hides real ones.\n\n4. The 10 uF bulk sits on VBUS, ahead of the regulator, not on the\n   3.3 V output.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n把 USB-C 接口进来的 5 V 降到 3.3 V，供本板以及两个远端采样节点使用。\n\n约束\n\n1. AP2112K-3.3，SOT-23-5 封装，600 mA。它对陶瓷输出电容是稳定的，\n   所以图上画的 1 uF 输入和 1 uF 输出是正确的，不需要换钽电容。\n\n2. 本板不给被测设备供电。3.3 V 经 JST-PH 输出，只用来驱动远端的\n   INA226 和远端的 PCA9615。被测设备自己供电，harness 只负责采它的\n   电源轨。这样采样侧始终留在 harness 的地上，这正是共享时基所需要\n   的，同时也让稳压器可以做得很小。\n\n3. VBUS 上挂了一个 PWR_FLAG，因为本板上没有任何东西驱动它。每条无\n   驱动的网络只放一个 PWR_FLAG。同一网络上放第二个，ERC 会报\"两个\n   电源输出连在一起\"，这是会掩盖真问题的假警报。\n\n4. 10 uF 的大电容放在 VBUS 上，位于稳压器之前，不是放在 3.3 V\n   输出端。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
